{'symbol': 'DISH', 'date': '2023-02-22 13:00:00', 'title': 'DISH WIRELESS LAUNCHES VIRTUAL OPEN RAN 5G NETWORK WITH SAMSUNG', 'text': "SAMSUNG DELIVERS AN INITIAL SHIPMENT OF 24,000 5G RADIOS, AND THE FIRST SAMSUNG-VIRTUALIZED RAN-SUPPORTED SITES GO LIVE ACROSS THE DISH OPEN RAN CLOUD-BASED 5G NETWORK SEOUL, KOREA AND LITTLETON, COLO. , FEB. 22, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SAMSUNG ELECTRONICS AND DISH WIRELESS (NYSE: DISH) LAUNCHED SAMSUNG-SUPPORTED SITES FOR THE DISH 5G NETWORK, MARKING THE BEGINNING OF SAMSUNG'S ROLE IN THE OPERATOR'S NATION-WIDE ROLLOUT."}